OL,3,GNEWSAArt sculpture set for major revamp
OL,4,
OL,5,FOne of East Lancashire's most
OL,6,Frecognisable landmarks could be set for
OL,7,Fa major overhaul of its surrounding
OL,8,Fpaths and fencing.
OL,10,FThe Singing Ringing Tree, which stands
OL,11,Fon Crown Point, in Burnley, needs
OL,12,Finfrastructure refurbishment to improve
OL,13,Faccessibilty for visitors, the council
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FDesigned by architects Mike Tonkin and
OL,17,FAnna Liu and completed in 2006, the
OL,18,FSinging Ringing Tree is a 3m (9.8ft)
OL,19,Fsculpture made from steel pipes that
OL,20,Fuses the wind to produce musical notes.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
