OL,3,GNEWSAArt sculpture set for major revamp
OL,4,
OL,5,FAhead of the borough's Year of Culture
OL,6,Fcelebrations next year, Burnley Council
OL,7,Fhas applied for permission to refurbish
OL,8,Fthe sculpture's surrounding footpaths,
OL,9,Ffencing, and infrastructure.
